# Local agent workspace. Everything here is machine-local and unvetted:
# .agents/plans/**/status.md  plan state and decision log
# .agents/pool/**            harvested candidates, machine-drafted descriptions
# .agents/link-report.json   link-check output
# One `git add .` with any of that staged would put unreviewed content into
# permanent history, which is unrecoverable. Do not remove this rule.
.agents/
